From a6e63fb8deeab6cce71e000ddd4949878a78085a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fabricio Akio <fabricioakio@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:22:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno: Record the batch's write when a query ends

fd_acc_end_query() emits the write of the query's available flag into
the current batch without recording the batch as a writer of the
query's buffer. Getting the result of a query no draw resumed then
neither flushes nor waits on that batch, and the queries issued before
it may not be available yet, as occlusion_query_order checks. Record
the write as fd_acc_query_resume() does.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Fabricio Akio <fabricioakio@gmail.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45554>
(cherry picked from commit e7371b0711bb1cd38c39d1c05e5578c445cc6bca)
